  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ISHR is an international human right&apos;s NGO, based in Geneva, working to advance human rights by offering support to HR defenders in their work with e.g. the UN System for Human Rights. ISHR constantly monitor the UN system and its development and disseminate this information to regional and national human rights organisations. ISHR provide qualified capacity building for NGO&apos;s around the UN HR system</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">International Service for Human Rights (ISHR) &#xE4;r en internationell m&#xE4;nskliga r&#xE4;ttighets organisation baserad i Geneve. ISHR st&#xF6;djer MR f&#xF6;rsvarare i deras arbete med bl a FN&apos;s system f&#xF6;r m&#xE4;nskliga r&#xE4;ttigheter. ISHR &#xF6;vervakar utvecklingen inom FN samt bidrar med kompetensuppbyggnad kring FN&apos;s MR system till s&#xE5;v&#xE4;l nationella som regional MR organisationer.</narrative>
  </description>
